        "func": "const minTemp = 24.0;\nconst maxTemp = 26.0;\nconst minHum = 40.0;\nconst maxHum = 45.0;\nconst minLight = 50.0;\nconst maxLight = 60.0;\n\nlet temperature = (Math.random() * (maxTemp - minTemp) + minTemp).toFixed(2);\nlet humidity = (Math.random() * (maxHum - minHum) + minHum).toFixed(2);\nlet lightDensity = (Math.random() * (maxLight - minLight) + minLight).toFixed(2);\n\n// Penting: Kita guna parseFloat() supaya data dihantar sebagai nombor (Float),\n// dan bukannya tulisan (String). InfluxDB sangat sensitif tentang jenis data.\nlet sensorData = {\n    temperature: parseFloat(temperature),\n    humidity: parseFloat(humidity),\n    light_density: parseFloat(lightDensity)\n};\n\n// Node MQTT akan automatik tukarkan objek ini ke JSON String\nreturn { payload: sensorData };",
